      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Flair Elegance, on route de Montferrat in Draguignan, is said to be a salon used to grooming large breeds, which is often trickier to handle than small ones.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The only source found is an independent directory (Servizgo), which gives the name "Flair Élégance" and a location on avenue de Montferrat in Draguignan; our listing gives 871 route de Montferrat. The Draguignan grooming directories we checked on 06/11/2026 (Mappy, Cylex, Salon Bichon, PagesJaunes) do not list this salon, and no official website or review was found. Prices, opening hours and the list of breeds are not published. A call to 07 66 76 63 09 before you go lets you give your dog's breed and size and ask about prices and availability.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: mention your dog's breed and size when booking, especially for a large dog, so the slot is planned accordingly — and use the call to make sure the salon still exists at this address.</div>

